{title: ii–V–I in C}
{artist: Practice progression}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 100}
{difficulty: advanced}
{strumming: Swing quarter notes, chords on 2 and 4}
{comment: The core jazz cadence. Listen for the seventh of each chord resolving down a step.}

{start_of_verse: Cadence}
| Dm7 | G7 | Cmaj7 | Cmaj7 |
| Dm7 | G7 | Cmaj7 | Cmaj7 |
{end_of_verse}
